@page "/tokens"
@* Part02 §3 - Design Tokens 亮/暗切换演示 *@

<PageTitle>Part02 · Tokens & Theme</PageTitle>

<h1>Tokens & Theme</h1>

<p>组件 CSS 只引用 <code>var(--color-*)</code>；主题切换 = 换 token，不改选择器。
   下面按钮通过 <code>html[data-theme]</code> 强制覆盖 <code>prefers-color-scheme</code>。</p>

<div class="card-grid" style="margin-block:1rem">
    @foreach (var sample in new[] { "primary", "surface", "surface-container", "outline-variant" })
    {
        <article class="card">
            <div style="height:3rem;border-radius:var(--radius-md);background:var(--color-@sample)"></div>
            <p class="list-row__sub">--color-@sample</p>
        </article>
    }
</div>

<button class="icon-btn" style="background:var(--color-primary);color:var(--color-on-primary)"
        @onclick="SetLight">Light</button>
<button class="icon-btn" style="background:var(--color-surface-container)"
        @onclick="SetDark">Dark</button>
<button class="icon-btn" style="background:var(--color-surface-container)"
        @onclick="SetAuto">Auto</button>

@code {
    [Inject] public IJSRuntime JS { get; set; } = default!;

    private async Task SetLight() => await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("eval", "document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','light')");
    private async Task SetDark() => await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("eval", "document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark')");
    private async Task SetAuto() => await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("eval", "document.documentElement.removeAttribute('data-theme')");
}